    "rationale": "The inherited categorical form is REFUTED: Jenkins deliberately added a constrained workflow language (Declarative Pipeline) because unconstrained Groovy was too expert-gated; GitHub Actions killed HCL and kept YAML as the workflow language; Step Functions still executes Amazon States Language and treats CDK as a generator of that IR. The weaker heuristic IS corroborated by Dagger leaving CUE, Prefect 2 dropping DAG-as-structure, and Airflow's Python-versus-XML pitch. Confirming the inherited anti-adoption without those counter-cases would have been the named failure mode.",
